---
import SiteHead from '@/components/SiteHead.astro'
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <SiteHead exactTitle="Dee on iPhone Duo — beside the mat" description="Your Muay Thai corner beside the mat. A landscape workout preview for Duo’s outer display, with a live simulator demo." image={{src:'/press/duo/round-timer.jpg',alt:'Dee’s landscape workout on Duo’s outer display'}} />
  <style>
    :root{color-scheme:dark;--ink:#102322;--paper:#eeeee5;--aqua:#34d2cb;--muted:#a6b6b1}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);font-family:"Avenir Next",Avenir,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:5px}button{font:inherit}header{max-width:1340px;margin:auto;padding:28px 5vw;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff26}.brand{font-size:29px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-2px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--aqua);font-weight:700}.hero{max-width:1340px;margin:auto;padding:78px 5vw 50px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.3fr;align-items:center;gap:4vw}.hero h1{font-family:"Helvetica Neue",Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(48px,5.6vw,82px);letter-spacing:-.065em;line-height:1.02;font-weight:700;margin:22px 0 28px}.hero h1 em{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;color:var(--aqua);letter-spacing:-.05em}.intro{max-width:360px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#c5d0cb}.cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:20px;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 20px;border:1px solid #77a29b;border-radius:30px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}.cta:hover{background:#ffffff12}.device{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:2194/1574;filter:drop-shadow(0 32px 35px #0008)}.screen{position:absolute;left:3.646%;top:5.591%;width:92.707%;height:88.819%;object-fit:fill;border-radius:8% 8% 1% 1%}.frame{position:relative;display:block;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none}.caption{font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;margin:26px auto 0;max-width:480px}.features{max-width:1210px;margin:0 auto 64px;padding:30px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-top:1px solid #ffffff26;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff26;gap:42px}.features h2{font-size:17px;margin:10px 0}.features p{font-size:14px;color:#b6c5bf;line-height:1.7;margin:0}.number{font-size:12px;color:var(--aqua);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.proof{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);padding:65px 5vw 74px}.proof-inner{max-width:1210px;margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;gap:60px;align-items:start}.proof .eyebrow{color:#18736f}.proof h2{font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-1.7px;line-height:1.1;margin:18px 0}.proof p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#495d58}.proof video{width:100%;display:block;border-radius:16px;background:#09100e;aspect-ratio:2034/1398}.proof small{display:block;font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:#647670;margin-top:16px}.status{display:inline-flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-top:20px}.status:before{content:"";width:7px;height:7px;background:#18736f;border-radius:100%}footer{max-width:1340px;margin:auto;padding:32px 5vw;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;line-height:1.7}footer p{max-width:600px;margin:0}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--aqua);outline-offset:6px}
    @media(max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:42px;gap:35px}.hero h1{max-width:600px}.intro{max-width:550px}.hero figure{margin:0}.features{margin:0 5vw 45px;gap:24px}.proof-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.proof h2{max-width:500px}.proof p{max-width:600px}footer{display:block}footer p+p{margin-top:18px}}
    @media(max-width:560px){header{padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px}header .eyebrow{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1px}.hero h1{font-size:54px}.features{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.features h2{margin:5px 0}.hero{padding-bottom:35px}.proof{padding-top:45px}.caption{font-size:10px}}
    @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<header><span class="brand">dee.</span><span class="eyebrow">iPhone Duo · workout preview</span></header>
<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div><div class="eyebrow">Your Muay Thai corner</div><h1>Your corner,<br><em>beside the mat.</em></h1><p class="intro">Prop up Duo. See your round, follow your next drill, and keep your hands free to train.</p><a class="cta" href="#live">Watch the working app ↗</a></div>
    <figure><div class="device"><img class="screen" src="/press/duo/round-timer.jpg" alt="Dee’s landscape workout: 02:45 remaining, shadowboxing, next rest, and pause controls"><img class="frame" src="/press/duo/iphone-duo-outer-landscape.png" alt="Official Apple iPhone Duo outer-display frame"></div><figcaption class="caption">Outer display, front view. Official Apple frame with an actual Dee simulator capture. This artwork does not depict the tent angle.</figcaption></figure>
  </section>
  <section class="features" aria-label="Workout benefits">
    <div><span class="number">01 / SEE YOUR ROUND</span><h2>A timer you can glance at.</h2><p>The timer and current drill sit together in landscape, with coaching detail alongside.</p></div>
    <div><span class="number">02 / KEEP YOUR FLOW</span><h2>Your controls stay in reach.</h2><p>Pause, skip, or finish while longer instructions scroll in their own area.</p></div>
    <div><span class="number">03 / STAY WITH IT</span><h2>The display stays awake.</h2><p>Dee keeps the screen on during a foreground workout and restores Auto-Lock afterward.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="proof" id="live"><div class="proof-inner">
    <div><div class="eyebrow">Captured from the working app</div><h2>Real rounds.<br>Real countdown.</h2><p>This recording runs a short sample workout on Duo’s outer display. Watch the work interval count down into recovery.</p><div class="status">Dee 1.0.12 · release preview</div><small>Captured in the iOS 27.1 simulator.<br>The still uses a frozen timer for presentation. The video uses the live workout clock. Audio is omitted.</small></div>
    <div><video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/press/duo/live-workout-start.jpg" aria-label="Live landscape workout transitioning into recovery"><source src="/press/duo/live-workout-landscape.mp4" type="video/mp4"><track kind="captions" src="/press/duo/live-workout-landscape.vtt" srclang="en" label="English"></video><small>Landscape behavior is verified in the simulator. The physical tent posture, outer-display handoff, and audio on a real Duo still need a hardware check.</small></div>
  </div></section>
</main>
<footer><p>Dee 1.0.12 is planned for release as soon as App Review approves it. The landscape workout is a release-candidate preview. Dee responds to landscape orientation; it does not detect a hinge angle. For review access, <a href="mailto:noamifergan@gmail.com?subject=Dee%20Duo%20review">contact Noam</a>.</p><p><a href="https://developer.apple.com/design/resources/#product-bezels">Apple Design Resources</a><br><a href="/press/">Full Dee press kit</a> · 22 September 2026</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
